        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos dar uma olhada em como os links funcionam para conectar um <strong>menu do jogo</strong> a outras <strong>telas do jogo</strong>. Clique em <code>Start mission!</code> para usar o link.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA; &lt;style&gt;&#xA;  body {&#xA;   background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #1f4037, #99f2c8);&#xA;   text-align: center;&#xA;   font-family: &quot;Verdana&quot;, Sans-serif;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  img {&#xA;   margin: 40px;&#xA;   height: 40px;&#xA;   width: 150px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h1 {&#xA;   margin-top: 30px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h3 {&#xA;   margin: 20px;&#xA;   font-weight: normal;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  p {&#xA;   margin-top: 80px;&#xA;   margin-left: 30px;&#xA;   margin-right: 30px;&#xA;   padding: 20px;&#xA;   background-color: DimGray;&#xA;  }&#xA; &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA; &lt;h1&gt;Ready to play?&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;a&#xA;  href=&quot;https://example.com/level-1&quot;&gt;Start&#xA;  mission!&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para começar a criar um link, adicionamos o texto entre as tags <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>. Isso ainda não destacará o texto.</p><p><code>&lt;a&gt;</code> significa tag \"Anchor\".</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Open Inventory\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para vincular o texto a uma página da web, adicionamos <code>href=\"\"</code> junto com um Localizador Uniforme de Recursos (<strong>URL</strong>). <code>href</code> é a abreviação de \"referência de hipertexto\".</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/leaderboard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"View High Scores\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>href</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"https://example.com/leaderboard\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href</code> é um <strong>atributo</strong>. Todos os atributos têm duas coisas em comum: eles fornecem informações extras e vão dentro da tag de abertura.</p><p>Os atributos são adicionados após o nome da tag e antes do sinal de fechamento <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/settings&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Settings\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nós vinculamos a uma página da web adicionando <code>=</code> após o atributo e uma URL como valor entre aspas.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/credits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"View Credits\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>\"</code> e depois <code>https://example.com/credits</code>, <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma tag de abertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> com o atributo <code>href</code> definido como <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/level-select&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Choose Level\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code> seguido de <code>a</code> e depois <code>href</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://example.com/level-select\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144756,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que os links fazem?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Vincular páginas de jogos a outras páginas e sites</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aumentar a saúde do jogador</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Vincular páginas de jogos a outras páginas e sites.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144757,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que o link não está funcionando?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque não tem um atributo <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque não há texto entre <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque não tem um atributo <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144758,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando um jogador clica no link nesta página do jogo?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/store&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Get Power-Ups\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   &amp; Skins\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O link direciona o jogador para outro site</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, porque o atributo <code>href</code> está faltando</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O link direciona o jogador para outro site.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que servem os <code>attributes</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para fornecer informações adicionais sobre tags</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para transformar todas as tags em inimigos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para fornecer informações adicionais sobre tags.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144760,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escolha a tag de abertura que torna o link clicável.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/wiki&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;a href=\"https://example.com/wiki\"&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione o atributo e seu valor para que, ao clicar no link, os jogadores sejam direcionados para a página da comunidade do jogo.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/community&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Join the Community\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>href</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"https://example.com/community\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Monte a tag para direcionar os jogadores para a página de notas do patch.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/patch-notes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Read Patch Notes\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;/</code> seguido de <code>a</code> e finalmente <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
